            {
                "entry_id": "52090186-b3a7-3d38-a3fc-9f724158ed24",
                "word": "YOLO",
                "pos": "phrase",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36cec084-068c-3ea5-a790-83f4d75bedba",
                        "entry_id": "52090186-b3a7-3d38-a3fc-9f724158ed24",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Acronym of you only live once, i.e. expressing the view that one should make the most of the present moment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "acronym",
                            "alt-of",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "955f3ea8-d1c8-4b84-9977-378b5d63d61b",
                                "sense_id": "36cec084-068c-3ea5-a790-83f4d75bedba",
                                "text": "Making this cake mix eleven years past the expiration date, because YOLO!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f31dd6c-cd39-463d-833a-a4e765cb8cf0",
                                "sense_id": "36cec084-068c-3ea5-a790-83f4d75bedba",
                                "text": "“Well, it's too late to turn back now, Brandon,” Ana said. “And anyway… YOLO, right?” Brandon looked like he was about to explode, but finally he rubbed his eyes and nodded. “Yeah. YOLO.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76402cf1-a621-41e3-ad7b-d3ef9cdc8cb3",
                                "sense_id": "36cec084-068c-3ea5-a790-83f4d75bedba",
                                "text": "“It made me come to this conclusion of, I don’t know, YOLO, let me just try this,” he said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe37971d-b0d4-4d4f-a479-47d65e67ecce",
                                "sense_id": "36cec084-068c-3ea5-a790-83f4d75bedba",
                                "text": "Individual YOLO decisions can be chalked up to many factors: cabin fever, low interest rates, the emergence of new get-rich-quick schemes like NFTs and meme stocks."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a81100c9-3fdf-4efd-bfb4-c4bb817347ae",
                        "source_entry_id": "52090186-b3a7-3d38-a3fc-9f724158ed24",
                        "source_sense_id": "36cec084-068c-3ea5-a790-83f4d75bedba",
                        "source_sense_description": "you only live once",
                        "target_lang_word": "yolo",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "yolo",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ce59d88-ad65-3cb7-b6f4-edd7bded6537",
                                        "entry_id": "02a47088-1e8f-324f-ad65-e28291872cf7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "je leeft maar één keer"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "chattaal",
                                            "uitroep wanneer je iets doet dat riskant is"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "072c2b7f-73b9-4448-a718-d7b897eb68e2",
                                                "sense_id": "3ce59d88-ad65-3cb7-b6f4-edd7bded6537",
                                                "text": "„Wij bepalen zelf wel of er een feestje is of niet”, zei een van de feestgangers na afloop, toen Project X op een veldslag met de politie was uitgelopen. De titel van het onderzoeksrapport naar de gebeurtenissen in Haren luidde: ‘Twee werelden. You Only Live Once.’ Yolo, maakt niet uit wat je overkomt, je leeft maar één keer, de kreet van de rebels without a cause van nu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1ef98e1-8c9b-49af-b9ae-0cdc7f4e4e47",
                        "source_entry_id": "52090186-b3a7-3d38-a3fc-9f724158ed24",
